␀A!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀R///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// RadarTargetInv
// Copyright 2002 Running With Scissors, Inc.  All Rights Reserved.
//
// Backup for radar inv, plugs into it (when used with radar)
