Ø×ˆ␀Õ9?,È␀iÕ␀␀B#␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀€?×ˆ␀Õ9?,È␀i(␀cJr␀k*(¦×ˆ␀Õ9?,,È␀iq!9!['␀␀␀␀␀M␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s//=============================================================================
// includes list of bots on team for multiplayer games
