StuckText1=You look like you're stuck.
StuckText2=There you go... now stay outta that spot!
MuggerHint1=They sound serious! Better drop your
MuggerHint2=money if you don't want to get hurt.
MuggerHint3=Find the money in your inventory and
MuggerHint4=press ' to drop it before they shoot!
CheckMapText1=Press 'F' to check the map for errands to complete.
CheckMapText2=HEY! Press 'F' to check the freakin' map for errands to do!
CheckMapText3=CHECK THE MAP AND LOOK AT YOUR ERRANDS!
CheckMapText4=THIS ANNOYING MESSAGE WILL GO AWAY IF YOU CHECK YOUR MAP!
NoMoreHealthItems=You're out of healing items.
DeathHints1=("Hmmm... looks like you're dying pretty quickly.","Instead of just standing around enjoying the pain,","try running and hiding from your aggressors.","Wait and hide from them and then attack them","when they come running around the corner to find you.")
DeathHints2=("Make sure to conserve your health powerups for the worst","fire-fights. Try to keep and eye on your health for the","best time for a health boost. Gather up lots of powerups","before going into a big battle.")
DeathHints3=("Take a slower pace when you get into fire-fights.","If you rush through an area of people who are trying to","kill you, get ready for a lot of damage.","Try moving along slowly, letting only a few of their","buddies know about you at once. They'll be easier to handle.")
FireDeathHints1=("That sure looks hot. I bet it hurts too.","Did you know there's a way to put yourself out","when you're on fire? Yup... there sure is.","Try thinking with you're lower half next time.")
